* graph sub-command
	* use GD to create image files.
* report sub-command
	* group by month and year

	* race [[this] (year|month) [X]]
		* Displays date, distance (and units), time, speed, bike, weight, average HR, max HR, calories, calories per hour, notes
			for the time period specificed (or all in DB if not).
		* And totals at the bottom.
	* race mileage [[this] (year|month) [X]] [ groupby (month|year) ]
		* Displays total racing distance (normalized to miles) for time peroid specificed (or all in DB if not).
	* race distance [[this] (year|month) [X]] [ groupby (month|year) ]
		* Displays total racing distance (and units) for time peroid specificed (or all in DB if not).

	* ride [[this] (year|month) [X]]
		* Displays date, distance (and units), time, speed, max speed, bike, weight, average HR, max HR, calories, calories per hour, with, notes
			for the time period specificed (or all in DB if not).
		* And totals at the bottom.
	* ride mileage ( see race mileage ).
	* ride distance ( see race distance ).
	* ride time [[this] (year|month) [X]] [ groupby (month|year) ]
		* Displays total ride time for time peroid specificed (or all in DB if not).

	* trainer [[this] (year|month) [X]]
		* Displays date, time, bike, weight, average HR, calories, calories per hour, notes
			for the time period specificed (or all in DB if not).
		* Adds NetAthlon data of Average Power, Average Cadence, Distance and Speed
		* And totals at the bottom.
	* trainer time [[this] (year|month) [X]] [ groupby (month|year) ]
		* Displays total trainer time spent for time peroid specificed (or all in DB if not).
